        "original_id": "aacce873-e9a3-5f37-b326-55e39f028fc5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lisa Gottlieb, Elizabeth Peña, Christina Applegate, Christopher Lloyd, Suzy Amis\n- Films: Across the Moon, Cadillac Ranch, La Bamba, Down and Out in Beverly Hills, Jacob's Ladder, Lone Star, Rush Hour, The Incredibles\n\nFacts:\n- Elizabeth Maria Peña was born on September 23, 1959, and died on October 14, 2014.\n- Elizabeth Peña was an American actress known for her work in the films La Bamba, Down and Out in Beverly Hills, Jacob's Ladder, Lone Star, Rush Hour, and The Incredibles.\n- In 1995, Lisa Gottlieb directed the film Across the Moon, which starred Christina Applegate and Elizabeth Peña.\n- In 1996, Lisa Gottlieb directed the film Cadillac Ranch, which starred Christopher Lloyd and Suzy Amis.",
